{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your numbers up in this Top down fast-paced Collectathon Target Practice Shooter - One miss and you lose the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/overshootersteamscreen4.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Challenge</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot targets and jewels come out, shoot the jewels before they fall to collect them and increase your jewel bank and points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More points and jewels are given the further you shoot a target. Shoot a target too close and you won't get as many jewels and points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One miss and you lose the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/jewelgreen.png?t=1743094744\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/jewelpurple.png?t=1743094744\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/jewelblue.png?t=1743094744\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/jewelred.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The target gets smaller the more targets that you shoot to make it more challenging.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/achievements_targets_10.jpg?t=1743094744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>High score</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/overshootersteamscreen5.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try and beat your high score with number of targets hit, number of points and total value of the jewels that you collect. Watch as your numbers go up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Skill Game</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/overshootersteamscreen2.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a skill game, where your reaction and aim really are tested. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get better at aiming the more that you play and have fun while doing it! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The better you get at aiming the more fun it is as you see your numbers going up fast as you get more jewels, points and targets hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Visuals and Sounds</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/icon.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visuals are colorful and responsive and sounds pop giving you a more immersive experience. Music is relaxing in the background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612520?t=1743094744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/877f7f7b3ea6b84c2a87da8cfcec5f0417eb6042/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743094744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/2dafd0542ece2da1ba931ce6a72d629b64c383cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743094744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/2dafd0542ece2da1ba931ce6a72d629b64c383cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743094744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your numbers up in this Top down fast-paced Collectathon Target Practice Shooter - One miss and you lose the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/overshootersteamscreen4.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Challenge</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot targets and jewels come out, shoot the jewels before they fall to collect them and increase your jewel bank and points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More points and jewels are given the further you shoot a target. Shoot a target too close and you won't get as many jewels and points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One miss and you lose the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/jewelgreen.png?t=1743094744\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/jewelpurple.png?t=1743094744\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/jewelblue.png?t=1743094744\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/jewelred.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The target gets smaller the more targets that you shoot to make it more challenging.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/achievements_targets_10.jpg?t=1743094744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>High score</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/overshootersteamscreen5.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try and beat your high score with number of targets hit, number of points and total value of the jewels that you collect. Watch as your numbers go up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Skill Game</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/overshootersteamscreen2.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a skill game, where your reaction and aim really are tested. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get better at aiming the more that you play and have fun while doing it! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The better you get at aiming the more fun it is as you see your numbers going up fast as you get more jewels, points and targets hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Visuals and Sounds</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/icon.png?t=1743094744\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visuals are colorful and responsive and sounds pop giving you a more immersive experience. Music is relaxing in the background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Chilled Out Duck Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/613